silm:instances_papers_18_presheaf_semantics_02_mittens_anchor_concrete_anchor_3_Cat_anchor#mittensvetrecordpresheafanchornode3 silm:hasLongDescription "The MittensVetRecordPresheafAnchorNode3 is the Cat-first source leg of D_Mittens that holds the Joy-of-Cats threshold reading without identifying Mittens with the bare taxon. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'Cat_anchor', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
